00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:29.280
have um an instruction tape in life? And that&nbsp;
instruction tape needs to have the instructions&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:29.280 --> 00:07:36.080
for building a self. Um but you know if if if&nbsp;
the self is copying the instruction tape then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:39.280
uh you know it would seem that you have to have an&nbsp;
