um that really investigates aiogenesis which is&nbsp;
to say the emergence of life out of non-life. Um&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:41:38.000 --> 00:41:46.720
here's how it works. We begin with very very&nbsp;
short random programs. So um they're uh only&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:41:46.720 --> 00:41:53.840
four instructions long, four bytes long and um and&nbsp;
