00:41:59.120 --> 00:42:03.920
out of it's just made out of instructions one&nbsp;
after another. And in this very simple language&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:42:03.920 --> 00:42:09.360
those instructions are exactly one bite. So, um,&nbsp;
you know, I'm when I say when I say they start&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:42:09.360 --> 00:42:16.240
off as random programs, all I mean is random bites&nbsp;
that, uh, that that do that do something. Uh, and,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:42:16.240 --> 00:42:19.360
um, you know, where do I get off with&nbsp;
the idea that they do something? Well,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:42:19.360 --> 00:42:23.520
uh, you know, molecules do something as well&nbsp;
