00:42:37.440 --> 00:42:42.720
something to another. And so that's that's all it&nbsp;
is. Uh, you know, and and the reason that I that I&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:42:42.720 --> 00:42:49.280
um used a minimal programming language for this&nbsp;
was just to ensure that the set of instructions&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:42:49.280 --> 00:42:55.760
that I was working with were sufficient to uh in&nbsp;
principle allow, you know, any kind of program&nbsp;&nbsp;

