see symbiogenesis leading to life and then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:46:17.520 --> 00:46:22.720
complexifying that life even in this very very&nbsp;
simple artificial system. And when you look at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:46:22.720 --> 00:46:29.120
at a at a BFF soup after it's been running for a&nbsp;
few million interactions, you find uh programs in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:46:29.120 --> 00:46:34.800
it that are that are that are definitely purposive&nbsp;
uh that that you know look like they were made by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:46:34.800 --> 00:46:39.760
an engineer. I mean, they look like they were made&nbsp;
by a mad engineer because uh you know, they're not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:46:39.760 --> 00:46:44.800
programmed in in in the way that you you know, you&nbsp;
rationally would as a programmer. Um but but they&nbsp;&nbsp;

